{"html":"<p>A Rust project's shape tells you a lot about its maturity. This module covers\nthe layout that scales, and the workspace tooling that makes a multi-crate repo\nbuildable in one command.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-canonical-layout\">The canonical layout</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>myapp/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── Cargo.lock</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── rust-toolchain.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── README.md</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── .gitignore</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── main.rs            # thin: parse args, call into lib, map errors</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── lib.rs             # the actual logic — testable</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── config.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── error.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── handlers/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│       ├── mod.rs         # or handlers.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│       └── users.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── tests/                 # integration tests: separate crates, public API only</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── api.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── benches/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── throughput.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── examples/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── quickstart.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── migrations/            # sqlx migrations</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── assets/</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"why-librs--mainrs\">Why <code>lib.rs</code> + <code>main.rs</code></h3>\n<p>Put logic in <code>lib.rs</code>, keep <code>main.rs</code> to ~20 lines. Three benefits:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Integration tests in <code>tests/</code> can only import the library.</strong> If everything\nlives in <code>main.rs</code>, you cannot test it from <code>tests/</code>.</li>\n<li><strong><code>examples/</code> can reuse it.</strong> Examples are tiny binaries that depend on your\nlibrary.</li>\n<li><strong>You can split the binary later</strong> — a second <code>[[bin]]</code> or a separate\n<code>server</code> crate — without moving code.</li>\n</ol>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// src/lib.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> config</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> error</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> handlers</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> error</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">AppError</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">AppResult</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">};</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(cfg</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> config</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Config</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> AppResult</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">    // real work</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    Ok</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(())</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// src/main.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">process</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> cfg </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> match</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> myapp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">config</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Config</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">from_env</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">() {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">        Ok</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(c) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> c,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">        Err</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(e) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">            eprintln!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"config error: {e}\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">            return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    };</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    match</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> myapp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(cfg) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">        Ok</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(()) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">        Err</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(e) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">            eprintln!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"fatal: {e:#}\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">            ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">FAILURE</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"module-files-foors-or-foomodrs\">Module files: <code>foo.rs</code> or <code>foo/mod.rs</code>?</h3>\n<p>Both work. Modern convention is <code>foo.rs</code> + <code>foo/</code> side by side:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── handlers.rs          # declares submodules</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── handlers/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    ├── users.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    └── billing.rs</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// src/handlers.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> billing</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> users</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>mod.rs</code> style still works and some codebases prefer it. Pick one per repo and\nbe consistent — mixing both in one tree confuses <code>rust-analyzer</code>'s file\nnavigation.</p>\n<h2 id=\"gitignore\"><code>.gitignore</code></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"gitignore\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"gitignore\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>/target</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>**/*.rs.bk</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>*.pdb</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>.env</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>.env.*</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>!.env.example</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>Cargo.lock</code> is <strong>not</strong> ignored for binaries — commit it. For libraries it is\noptional; committing it is now common practice because it makes CI reproducible.</p>\n<h2 id=\"workspaces-many-crates-one-build\">Workspaces: many crates, one build</h2>\n<p>Once you have a server, a CLI, a shared domain crate and a migration crate, you\nwant one <code>cargo build</code> at the root and one shared <code>target/</code> directory.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>myapp/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── Cargo.toml           # the workspace root — virtual manifest</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── crates/</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── core/            # domain types, no I/O</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   │   ├── Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   │   └── src/lib.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   ├── api/             # HTTP layer</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   │   ├── Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   │   └── src/main.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│   └── worker/          # background jobs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│       ├── Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>│       └── src/main.rs</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── target/              # shared by every member</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># ./Cargo.toml  — virtual manifest: no [package], only [workspace]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">workspace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">resolver = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"2\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">members = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"crates/core\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"crates/api\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"crates/worker\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># Dependencies declared once, inherited by members — one place to bump versions</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">workspace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">dependencies</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">serde = { version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"derive\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">] }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">serde_json = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"1\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">tokio = { version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"full\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">] }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">sqlx = { version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"0.8\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"runtime-tokio\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"postgres\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"macros\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">] }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">tracing = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--sh