">unsafe_code = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">missing_debug_implementations = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">workspace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">lints</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">clippy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">all = { level = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, priority = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">-1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">unwrap_used = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"warn\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># each member</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">lints</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">workspace = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Lint configuration at the workspace level means a new crate cannot accidentally\nbe less strict than the rest. <code>priority = -1</code> is needed so the group <code>all</code> does\nnot override the individual lint that follows.</p>\n<h2 id=\"splitting-into-crates-when\">Splitting into crates: when?</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Symptom</th>\n<th>Do this</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo build</code> takes 3+ minutes</td>\n<td>Split rarely-changed code into a crate; it stops recompiling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Two binaries share code</td>\n<td>Shared library crate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>You want to unit-test without a DB</td>\n<td><code>core</code> crate with no I/O dependencies</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compile-time feature flags differ per binary</td>\n<td>Separate crates</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Just \"for tidiness\"</td>\n<td><strong>Don't.</strong> Modules are free; crates cost compile time</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Rule of thumb:</strong> start with modules. Split into crates when compile time or\nfeature-flag isolation forces you to, not before. Each crate boundary is a\nreal API you now have to maintain.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"feature-flags-conditional-compilation\">Feature flags: conditional compilation</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">features</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">default = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">json = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"dep:serde_json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">postgres = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"sqlx/postgres\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">metrics = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"dep:prometheus\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">#[cfg(feature </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> metrics</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">#[cfg(feature </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"postgres\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> pg_pool</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> sqlx</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">PgPool</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">/* ... */</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> }</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --no-default-features</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --features</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> postgres</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> tree</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> features</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> serde</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">   # why is serde enabled?</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Gotcha:</strong> features are <strong>additive and unified</strong> across the whole graph. If\nany crate in the graph enables <code>tokio/full</code>, <em>you</em> get <code>full</code>. You cannot use\na feature to <em>remove</em> something. Design features as \"add capability\", never\n\"turn off the other thing\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"practical-exercise-build-the-skeleton\">Practical exercise: build the skeleton</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --lib</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> crates/domain</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> crates/api</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> crates/worker</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Then write the root <code>Cargo.toml</code> as a virtual manifest, add\n<code>version.workspace = true</code> to each member, and confirm:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --workspace</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> api</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"exercises\">Exercises</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Convert a single-crate project into a workspace with <code>domain</code>, <code>api</code> and\n<code>worker</code> members. Share <code>serde</code> and <code>tokio</code> via <code>[workspace.dependencies]</code>.</li>\n<li>Add a <code>metrics</code> feature to <code>domain</code> that compiles a module only when enabled.\nVerify with <code>cargo build -p domain --features metrics</code> and\n<code>cargo doc -p domain --no-default-features</code>.</li>\n<li>Add <code>[workspace.lints]</code> forbidding <code>unwrap_used</code>. Fix the resulting warnings\nin a real function — this is a good preview of module 02.07.</li>\n<li>Add <code>tests/</code> integration tests that use only the public API of <code>domain</code>.\nConfirm they cannot see private items.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Next:</strong> <a href=\"../02-language/01-variables-types-mutability.md\">Variables, types, mutability</a></p>"}